<title>USA: Chart of job gains and losses by state.</title>
<headline>Chart of job gains and losses by state.</headline>
<dateline>MURRAY HILL, N.J.</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a chart of company and job moves by state or U.S. territory or commonwealth detailed in a Dun &amp; Bradstreet survey released Tuesday, ranked by the number of jobs gained or lost.</p>
<p>For each state, the chart lists how many companies and how many jobs it gained or lost.</p>
